{"parse":{"title":"个性/闪耀的勇气","pageid":6345,"revid":14638,"text":"<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<div id=\"bread-edit\" class=\"bread-edit\" style=\"float:right;margin-top:10px;margin-right:10px\"><sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%97%AA%E8%80%80%E7%9A%84%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94&amp;action=edit\">编</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%97%AA%E8%80%80%E7%9A%84%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94&amp;action=purge\">刷</a></sup> <sup><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://wiki.biligame.com/llzj/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7/%E9%97%AA%E8%80%80%E7%9A%84%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94&amp;action=history\">历</a></sup></div>\n<div style=\"padding: 5px 10px;margin: 10px 0;border: 1px solid #ebccd1;border-left-width: 5px;border-radius: 3px;background: rgb(255 255 255 / 40%);\">\n<a href=\"/llzj/%E9%A6%96%E9%A1%B5\" title=\"首页\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"/llzj/%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93\" title=\"技能图鉴库\">技能图鉴库</a> &gt; <b>闪耀的勇气</b><br /></div>\n<hr />\n<h2><span id=\".E9.97.AA.E8.80.80.E7.9A.84.E5.8B.87.E6.B0.94\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"闪耀的勇气\"><b>闪耀的勇气</b></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/llzj/index.php?title=%E6%A8%A1%E6%9D%BF:%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"编辑章节：\">编辑</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"3\">个性详情\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><img alt=\"个性 闪耀的勇气.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f8/8cj2j2wfv6kvux9v88nmi48cbgd4gw5.png/80px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%97%AA%E8%80%80%E7%9A%84%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/f8/8cj2j2wfv6kvux9v88nmi48cbgd4gw5.png/120px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7_%E9%97%AA%E8%80%80%E7%9A%84%E5%8B%87%E6%B0%94.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/f/f8/8cj2j2wfv6kvux9v88nmi48cbgd4gw5.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /><br />闪耀的勇气\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:60%;\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性一星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/f/ff/it8jh8njwjg4jrxn4b2f0iwnlxlm1a7.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%80%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]并被攻击时，或主动攻击后自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">护盾值</font></span></span>]降低时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名敌人，附加自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>生命值的物理伤害，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次。<br />✦生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">5%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"满满安全感护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">满满安全感护盾</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，效果冷却<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\" rowspan=\"5\"><b>该个性属于</b><br /><br /><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:90px;height:90px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%85%8B%E6%8B%89%E6%8B%89\" title=\"角色图鉴库/克拉拉\"><img alt=\"头像 克拉拉.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/1/1b/he10i3yxupczk82a0dnmgnkcfe0rtzn.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"90\" height=\"90\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:90px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">克拉拉</font></div>\n</div>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性二星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e0/s8dzgwxdvuvhjug8aqjcnr6vmgsi5ao.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%8C%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]并被攻击时，或主动攻击后自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">护盾值</font></span></span>]降低时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名敌人，附加自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>生命值的物理伤害，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次。<br />✦生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">5%</font>。<br />✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"满满安全感护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">满满安全感护盾</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，效果冷却<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有光环，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方，受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性三星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/0/07/czx3heixk04558ia8wj7hpokhzl5cbx.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%B8%89%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]并被攻击时，或主动攻击后自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">护盾值</font></span></span>]降低时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名敌人，附加自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>生命值的物理伤害，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次。<br />✦生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">10%</font>；自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"满满安全感护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">满满安全感护盾</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合，效果冷却<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有光环，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方，受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性四星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/1/10/eer5d47lht2ycljkd8fe3yu05q10ccr.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E5%9B%9B%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]并被攻击时，或主动攻击后自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">护盾值</font></span></span>]降低时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名敌人，附加自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>生命值的物理伤害，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>次。<br />✦生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">15%</font>；自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"满满安全感护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">满满安全感护盾</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有光环，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方，受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\">&#160;<img alt=\"个性五星.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/56px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"56\" height=\"14\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/84px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/2/20/l6fgusj2lxp7caktkwbmf1ioo2m7utz.png/112px-%E4%B8%AA%E6%80%A7%E4%BA%94%E6%98%9F.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"224\" data-file-height=\"56\" /><br />&#160;\n<p>✦拥有[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]并被攻击时，或主动攻击后自身[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾值\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">护盾值</font></span></span>]降低时，对自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内随机<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>名敌人，附加自身<font color=\"#ed7950\">25%</font>生命值的物理伤害，每回合最多触发<font color=\"#ed7950\">4</font>次。<br />✦任意己方拥有的[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"满满安全感护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">满满安全感护盾</font></span></span>]被击破时，[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\">克拉拉</span>]使其获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"免伤3\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">免伤3</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦生命值提高<font color=\"#58cb48\">25%</font>；自身获得[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"orange\">护盾</font></span></span>]时，回复<font color=\"#58cb48\">1</font>点能量。<br />✦行动开始时，使自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"满满安全感护盾\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">满满安全感护盾</font></span></span>]，首次行动时自身额外获得<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>层，再驱散<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>个[<span style=\"display:inline;white-space:nowrap;\"><span data-type=\"@悬浮框/中括号介绍\" data-name=\"减益\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#f3c156\">减益</font></span></span>]，持续<font color=\"#ed7950\">2</font>回合。<br />✦拥有光环，效果：自身范围<font color=\"#ed7950\">3</font>格内所有己方，受到魔法伤害降低<font color=\"#d68fe2\">20%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022030255\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\n[SMW] In‐text annotation parser time: 0 seconds\nCPU time usage: 0.304 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.445 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4582/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 63491/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 20299/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 13/40\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  401.830      1 模板:个性\n100.00%  401.830      1 -total\n 53.17%  213.644      5 模板:中括号介绍化\n 47.98%  192.795     22 模板:中括号介绍\n  2.46%    9.898      1 模板:面包屑\n  1.26%    5.054      1 模板:列表/头像\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key gamecenter_wiki_llzj-pre_:pcache:idhash:6345-0!dateformat=default and timestamp 20261022030254 and revision id 14638. Serialized with PHP.\n -->\n</div>","categories":[{"sortkey":"","category":"个性","missing":true}],"images":["个性_闪耀的勇气.png","个性一星.png","头像_克拉拉.png","个性二星.png","个性三星.png","个性四星.png","个性五星.png"],"sections":[{"toclevel":1,"level":"2","line":"<b>闪耀的勇气</b>","number":"1","index":"T-1","fromtitle":"模板:个性","byteoffset":null,"anchor":"闪耀的勇气"}],"displaytitle":"个性/闪耀的勇气","wikitext":"{{个性\n|个性名称=闪耀的勇气\n|个性图标=闪耀的勇气\n|个性描述1=✦拥有[<font color=#f3c156>护盾</font>]并被攻击时，或主动攻击后自身[护盾值]降低时，对自身范围<font color=#ed7950